1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:06,698
A village… an old peepal tree… and a ghost who has lived in it for two hundred years.

2
00:00:06,718 --> 00:00:11,138
Name: Chaman Bhoot. Job: scaring people. Record: zero.

3
00:00:16,808 --> 00:00:21,864
Licence cancelled?! Where will I go? I can't even fly properly!

4
00:00:22,534 --> 00:00:27,020
Fine. Tonight… Dadi will be scared. Five plans… all foolproof!

5
00:00:29,670 --> 00:00:33,822
Clink… clink… clink… I have brought my chains!

6
00:00:34,992 --> 00:00:38,789
Why are they squeaking so much? Have you never oiled them?

7
00:00:38,809 --> 00:00:41,970
You don't oil a ghost's chains!

8
00:00:41,990 --> 00:00:46,185
Then oil my door instead. It squeaks too.

9
00:00:50,155 --> 00:00:53,588
Darkness… everyone is afraid of the dark.

10
00:00:56,158 --> 00:00:58,995
Ha ha ha… who will save you now?

11
00:00:59,665 --> 00:01:03,144
Don't shine the torch in my eyes! Don't shine it in my eyes!

12
00:01:03,164 --> 00:01:06,225
A two-hundred-year-old ghost… scared of a torch.

13
00:01:06,245 --> 00:01:08,111
Go on, light the lamp again.

14
00:01:12,281 --> 00:01:14,831
I am… a chudail… my long… black… hair…

15
00:01:15,701 --> 00:01:19,167
Oh my, such tangled hair! Have you ever oiled it?

16
00:01:19,187 --> 00:01:21,365
Chudails don't oil their hair!

17
00:01:21,385 --> 00:01:24,880
That's exactly why they look scary. Sit, I'll give you a head massage.

18
00:01:26,250 --> 00:01:30,711
Ahh… first time in two hundred years… this feels so good.

19
00:01:31,281 --> 00:01:33,485
Hey! This wasn't the plan at all!

20
00:01:37,255 --> 00:01:42,251
They say a ghost hanging upside down from a peepal tree is the most dangerous of all.

21
00:01:42,271 --> 00:01:44,140
Dadi… look up…

22
00:01:44,710 --> 00:01:49,320
What will you get hanging upside down? Straighten up, the blood will rush to your head.

23
00:01:49,340 --> 00:01:51,969
Ghosts don't have blood, Dadi!

24
00:01:51,989 --> 00:01:54,177
Then you don't have a brain either.

25
00:01:58,147 --> 00:02:02,259
No plans left. From tomorrow, I won't even be a ghost.

26
00:02:02,279 --> 00:02:03,897
What happened? Tell me.

27
00:02:03,917 --> 00:02:08,911
The Ghost Union wrote… if you aren't scared, my licence is cancelled.

28
00:02:10,081 --> 00:02:12,713
That's all? Give me the paper.

29
00:02:17,883 --> 00:02:20,188
But Dadi… you weren't scared at all!

30
00:02:20,208 --> 00:02:24,445
You've lived in my tree for two hundred years. You're a ghost… but you're family.

31
00:02:24,795 --> 00:02:26,122
Here, have some tea.

32
00:02:29,692 --> 00:02:35,782
That morning, the Ghost Union received a letter. And Chaman Bhoot's licence… was saved.

33
00:02:35,802 --> 00:02:39,586
Thank you, Dadi! I'll be going… the sun is coming up!

34
00:02:41,356 --> 00:02:45,217
Yes, yes, go. And listen… come back tonight. There are lots of dishes waiting.

